{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_FE94ACC6","title":"Ptolemy 4","entry":"Dlg_FE94ACC6::entry","exit":"Dlg_FE94ACC6::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_BA6AD9BD","articyId":"72057752951742015","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ptolemy","text":"Hey guess what? I've put the Ana-Blog to rest. I’ve found something even more transformative—a single-player digital card game.","speakerId":"Ntt_26BC379F","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hey guess what? I've put the Ana-Blog to rest. I’ve found something even more transformative—a single-player digital card game.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":300.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44918","byteOffset":31327088,"byteLength":440}},{"id":"DFr_1037968F","articyId":"72057752951742029","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ptolemy","text":"Not by myself, with myself. It’s a battle of wits, a psychological deep dive, a duel between my own impulses. Every hand is a lesson in restraint, every bluff a meditation on truth.","speakerId":"Ntt_26BC379F","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Not by myself, with myself. It’s a battle of wits, a psychological deep dive, a duel between my own impulses. Every hand is a lesson in restraint, every bluff a meditation on truth.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":900.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37174","byteOffset":28404664,"byteLength":492}},{"id":"DFr_F94FB84F","articyId":"72057752951742043","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ptolemy","text":"Oh, I’m more connected than ever—to my instincts, my desires, my own mind. When I go all-in against myself, who really wins? Who really loses? It’s existential, baby.","speakerId":"Ntt_26BC379F","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Oh, I’m more connected than ever—to my instincts, my desires, my own mind. When I go all-in against myself, who really wins? Who really loses? It’s existential, baby.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":1500.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"27505","byteOffset":18286928,"byteLength":516}},{"id":"DFr_F898D054","articyId":"72057752951742057","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ptolemy","text":"Addicted? No, no, no. I’m immersed. I've transcended the need for an opponent. In a way, I've become the purest form of gambler—one who plays only for the thrill of the risk, without the corruption of others.","speakerId":"Ntt_26BC379F","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Addicted? No, no, no. I’m immersed. I've transcended the need for an opponent. In a way, I've become the purest form of gambler—one who plays only for the thrill of the risk, without the corruption of others.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":2125.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31601","byteOffset":19836360,"byteLength":556}},{"id":"DFr_811EF426","articyId":"72057752951742071","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ptolemy","text":"Oh, please. The Ana-Blog was a symptom of my past delusions. This?","speakerId":"Ntt_26BC379F","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Oh, please. The Ana-Blog was a symptom of my past delusions. This?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2725.0,"y":200.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45297","byteOffset":31470552,"byteLength":376}},{"id":"DFr_2F666B8E","articyId":"72057821671320594","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ptolemy","text":"This is truth. Now, if you’ll excuse me, I have a full house against myself, and I’m dying to see if I’ll fold.","speakerId":"Ntt_26BC379F","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"This is truth. Now, if you’ll excuse me, I have a full house against myself, and I’m dying to see if I’ll fold.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":3050.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20432","byteOffset":15611896,"byteLength":428}},{"id":"DFr_85A5AB07","articyId":"72057821671320602","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ptolemy","text":"You can call it self-corruption. But this?","speakerId":"Ntt_26BC379F","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You can call it self-corruption. But this?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2725.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17391","byteOffset":14467968,"byteLength":352}},{"id":"DFr_CE1C2BEB","articyId":"72057752951742022","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Wait… a card game? By yourself? On a computer?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Wait… a card game? By yourself? On a computer?","TextSheVersion":"Wait… a card game? By yourself? On a computer?","TextTheyVersion":"Wait… a card game? By yourself? On a computer?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":600.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"16593","byteOffset":14172048,"byteLength":328}},{"id":"DFr_73A29C6E","articyId":"72057752951742036","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"You used to be all about real-world connection. What happened?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You used to be all about real-world connection. What happened?","TextSheVersion":"You used to be all about real-world connection. What happened?","TextTheyVersion":"You used to be all about real-world connection. What happened?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1200.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25911","byteOffset":17685120,"byteLength":344}},{"id":"DFr_D6108186","articyId":"72057752951742050","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"You sound like you're just addicted to a card game.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You sound like you're just addicted to a card game.","TextSheVersion":"You sound like you're just addicted to a card game.","TextTheyVersion":"You sound like you're just addicted to a card game."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1825.0,"y":200.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18212","byteOffset":14776848,"byteLength":332}},{"id":"DFr_749FF9BD","articyId":"72057752951742064","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"This might be sadder than the Ana-Blog.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"This might be sadder than the Ana-Blog.","TextSheVersion":"This might be sadder than the Ana-Blog.","TextTheyVersion":"This might be sadder than the Ana-Blog."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2425.0,"y":200.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39494","byteOffset":29270248,"byteLength":320}},{"id":"DFr_7B829350","articyId":"72057821671320579","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Sounds like a very philosophical of addiction!","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"loc